  "body_html": "<h1>Ex-Ante Equilibrium Predicates</h1>\n<p>Bayesian mechanisms with transfers include integrability assumptions for\nex-ante expected utility and an ex-ante Bayesian Nash equilibrium predicate.</p>\n<p>The direct Bayesian transfer mechanism interface also provides the truthful\nstrategy profile used in revelation-principle statements.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:md_ex_ante_equilibrium] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
